{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 16 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生理时序模型：门控、膨胀卷积、长状态与领域预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Temporal Physiological AI</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_137_ecgfounder-title\">ECGFounder</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">ECGFounder 是 RegNet/Net1D 风格的 1D CNN foundation model，以超过千万波形和 150 类监督规模为核心，不应误写为通用 Transformer SSL。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">1D RegNet-style residual CNN with Squeeze-and-Excitation blocks pretrained via multi-label clinical supervision across &gt;10 million 12-lead ECGs and 150 diagnostic categories.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">标准化的 12 导联或适配后的任意单导联 ECG 波形</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Raw multi-lead (12-lead) or lead-masked single-lead 1D ECG voltage waveform tensor</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">150 类诊断概率、通用 ECG embedding 与下游微调预测</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">150-class diagnostic probability vector and general-purpose 1D ECG representation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 1 · PDF p.10</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1056/AIoa2401033\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"ECGFounder original paper architecture figure, Figure 1\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/1202c03449ed835d1e34.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 1 · PDF p.10</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_137_ecgfounder\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_137_ecgfounder\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">Raw multi-lead ECG</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Raw multi-lead ECG</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">滤波、定长切片和逐导联 z-score 后输入</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests raw multi-lead (12-lead) or lead-masked single-lead 1d ecg voltage waveform tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Raw multi-lead ECG).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"滤波、定长切片和逐导联 z-score 后输入\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests raw multi-lead (12-lead) or lead-masked single-lead 1d ecg voltage waveform tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Raw multi-lead ECG).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"Raw multi-lead ECG\" data-node-name-en=\"Raw multi-lead ECG\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Raw multi-lead ECG</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">滤波、定长切片和逐导联 z-score 后输入</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests raw multi-lead (12-lead) or lead-masked single-lead 1d ecg voltage waveform tensor and prepares initial tensor representations (Raw multi-lead ECG).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1D 卷积建立早期局部波形特征并下采样\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes Net1D/RegNet-1D stem to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"Net1D/RegNet-1D stem\" data-node-name-en=\"Net1D/RegNet-1D stem\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Net1D/RegNet-1D stem</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1D 卷积建立早期局部波形特征并下采样</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes Net1D/RegNet-1D stem to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1、k×1 group convolution、1×1 卷积组成分阶段 RegNet blocks\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs residual bottlenecks within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"多阶段 residual bottlenecks\" data-node-name-en=\"residual bottlenecks\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多阶段 residual bottlenecks</span><span class=\"lang-en\">residual bottlenecks</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1、k×1 group convolution、1×1 卷积组成分阶段 RegNet blocks</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs residual bottlenecks within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"按通道重标定导联/特征响应，融合跨导联相关性\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Squeeze-and-Excitation within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"Squeeze-and-Excitation\" data-node-name-en=\"Squeeze-and-Excitation\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Squeeze-and-Excitation</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按通道重标定导联/特征响应，融合跨导联相关性</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Squeeze-and-Excitation within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"汇聚不同时间位置的层级波形特征\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Temporal global pooling within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Temporal global pooling\" data-node-name-en=\"Temporal global pooling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Temporal global pooling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">汇聚不同时间位置的层级波形特征</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Temporal global pooling within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"可冻结抽取或继续全量微调\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs ECG foundation embedding within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"ECG foundation embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"ECG foundation embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ECG foundation embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">可冻结抽取或继续全量微调</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs ECG foundation embedding within the core clinical scale 1d regnet ecg foundation computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用心电专家/机器结构化诊断做大规模多标签监督预训练\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies 150-label sigmoid head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"150-label sigmoid head\" data-node-name-en=\"150-label sigmoid head\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>150-label sigmoid head</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用心电专家/机器结构化诊断做大规模多标签监督预训练</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies 150-label sigmoid head to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"心律失常、结构性心脏病、风险、人口学或单导联任务\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces 150-class diagnostic probability vector and general-purpose 1d ecg representation via Out-of-box/transfer heads.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Out-of-box/transfer heads\" data-node-name-en=\"Out-of-box/transfer heads\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_137_ecgfounder', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Out-of-box/transfer heads</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">心律失常、结构性心脏病、风险、人口学或单导联任务</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces 150-class diagnostic probability vector and general-purpose 1d ecg representation via Out-of-box/transfer heads.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"ECGFounder Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 1D RegNet-SE 残差编码与 150 标签心电预训练</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Multi-Stage 1D Residual-SE Convolutional Backbone Trained on 150-Class Clinical ECG Ontology</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"ECGFounder：核心公式 · 1D RegNet-SE 残差编码与 150 标签心电预训练\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"137\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"28.897727pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.463972 -67.992624 378.284655 28.897727\" width=\"378.284655pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><use id=\"m137_g26-49\" transform=\"scale(1.369862)\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g23-49\"></use><use id=\"m137_g26-69\" tr