link:href=\"#m137_g13-186\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"260.839384\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g26-108\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"263.608997\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g26-111\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"268.590317\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g26-103\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"274.069771\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g13-185\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"277.785831\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g26-49\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"284.981017\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g13-0\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"294.900967\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g26-94\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"293.929624\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g19-72\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"299.078818\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g16-58\" y=\"-49.326531\"></use><use x=\"303.57328\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g13-186\" y=\"-50.820911\"></use><use x=\"307.388956\" xlink:href=\"#m137_g13-188\" y=\"-50.835855\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">ECG 模型多依赖单中心小数据和任务专用标签，跨机构泛化有限</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Prior ECG models were trained on narrow diagnostic subsets or small single-hospital cohorts, failing on rare arrhythmias and single-lead wearables.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在超过千万份原始多导联 ECG 上预训练通用时序编码器并迁移多任务</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Scale a domain-engineered 1D CNN (Net1D / RegNet with SE channel attention and lead-dropout augmentation) across &gt;10M clinical ECGs annotated with a 150-label hierarchical ontology.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">利用卫生系统规模波形和多任务评测学习可复用 ECG 表征</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Massive 10M-waveform clinical supervision + lead-masking augmentation enabling seamless transfer from 12-lead hospital ECGs to single-lead wearable patches.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">用于心律失常、结构性心脏病和风险预测等 ECG 任务</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">High-performing open-weight ECG foundation baseline for arrhythmia diagnosis, structural heart disease screening, and wearable ECG triage.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">超大规模 ECG FM 代表；设备、群体公平性和前瞻效益仍需验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Proves that a well-engineered 1D CNN at 10M-sample clinical scale rivals or outperforms complex Transformers; prospective clinical trial validation remains the next frontier.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">以 RegNet 设计规则构造多阶段 1D 残差 CNN，而非 Transformer 或自监督掩码模型。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">group convolution 与 SE 通道注意力同时提取局部时序形态和多导联关联。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">在千万级 ECG、150 个结构化诊断上做多标签监督预训练，再迁移到新任务或单导联。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Scale a domain-engineered 1D CNN (Net1D / RegNet with SE channel attention and lead-dropout augmentation) across &gt;10M clinical ECGs annotated with a 150-label hierarchical ontology.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Massive 10M-waveform clinical supervision + lead-masking augmentation enabling seamless transfer from 12-lead hospital ECGs to single-lead wearable patches.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Multi-Stage 1D Residual-SE Convolutional Backbone Trained on 150-Class Clinical ECG Ontology.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">可直接输出广泛 ECG 诊断概率，也可作为心律、结构病和风险预测的通用 encoder。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">标签来自真实世界读图流程，可能包含机器解释与机构编码偏差；单导联适配不能假设等同于完整 12 导联证据。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: High-performing open-weight ECG foundation baseline for arrhythmia diagnosis, structural heart disease screening, and wearable ECG triage.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Proves that a well-engineered 1D CNN at 10M-sample clinical scale rivals or outperforms complex Transformers; prospective clinical trial validation remains the next frontier.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1056/AIoa2401033\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>An Electrocardiogram Foundation Model Built on over 10 Million Recordings</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/bdsp-core/ECGFounder\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}